Input: {"question": "Which Wikimedia project has Margreet Honig been listed on the focus list for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 83, "text": "Title: The Unseen Harmony: Margreet Honig's Legacy and the Quest for Gender Balance"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 85, "end": 266, "text": "In the realm of classical music, few sopranos have left an indelible mark like Margreet Honig, a Dutch virtuoso whose voice soared to great heights, captivating audiences worldwide."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 267, "end": 440, "text": "Yet, despite her remarkable achievements, Honig's story remained largely untold, a testament to the pervasive gender gap that has long plagued the world of music and beyond."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 441, "end": 582, "text": "It is here that the Wikimedia project NL Gendergap maintenance comes into play, a beacon of hope in the quest for balance and representation."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 583, "end": 752, "text": "As we delve into the life and career of Margreet Honig, it becomes apparent that her inclusion on the focus list of NL Gendergap maintenance is not merely a coincidence."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 753, "end": 819, "text": "Born in 1953, Honig's rise to fame was not without its challenges."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 820, "end": 982, "text": "In an era where women were often relegated to secondary roles, she defied convention, becoming one of the first female sopranos to gain international recognition."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 983, "end": 1105, "text": "Honig's talent was undeniable, with a voice that effortlessly navigated the complexities of opera, oratorio, and art song."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1106, "end": 1244, "text": "Her performances were met with critical acclaim, earning her numerous awards and nominations, including the prestigious Dutch Music Prize."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1245, "end": 1402, "text": "Despite these achievements, Honig's story remained largely absent from the digital realm, a glaring omission that NL Gendergap maintenance sought to rectify."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1403, "end": 1572, "text": "The NL Gendergap maintenance project, a Dutch Wikimedia initiative, was established to address the systemic gender imbalance that pervades online knowledge repositories."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1573, "end": 1704, "text": "By focusing on notable women like Margreet Honig, the project aims to create a more inclusive and representative digital landscape."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1705, "end": 1899, "text": "Honig's inclusion on the focus list is a testament to her significance, as well as the project's commitment to amplifying the voices and stories of women who have been historically marginalized."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1900, "end": 1992, "text": "As we explore Honig's life and career, it becomes clear that her experiences are not unique."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1993, "end": 2146, "text": "Women like her, who have made substantial contributions to their respective fields, have often been overlooked or underrepresented in the digital sphere."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2147, "end": 2325, "text": "The NL Gendergap maintenance project seeks to challenge this status quo, recognizing that the absence of women's stories and achievements perpetuates a distorted view of history."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2326, "end": 2442, "text": "Through Honig's story, we gain insight into the ways in which gender bias has shaped our understanding of the world."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2443, "end": 2569, "text": "We see how women's contributions have been systematically erased or downplayed, leading to a skewed representation of reality."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 144, "text": "As Margreet Honig stepped off the stage, the applause still echoing in her ears, she couldn't help but feel a sense of pride and accomplishment."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 145, "end": 291, "text": "Her performance of Verdi's La Traviata at the Amsterdam Concertgebouw had been nothing short of breathtaking, and the crowd had responded in kind."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 292, "end": 385, "text": "Backstage, she was greeted with a bouquet of flowers and a warm smile from her manager, Hans."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 386, "end": 454, "text": "\"Margreet, you were sublime tonight,\" Hans said, beaming with pride."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 455, "end": 579, "text": "\"I've received calls from several promoters already, inquiring about your availability for upcoming festivals and concerts.\""}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 580, "end": 688, "text": "Margreet smiled, feeling a sense of gratitude towards Hans, who had been instrumental in shaping her career."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 689, "end": 830, "text": "As they chatted, a young woman with a notebook and pen approached them, introducing herself as Sophia, a volunteer for WikiProject Badminton."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 831, "end": 950, "text": "\"I'm so sorry to interrupt, but I'm a huge fan of your music, Margreet,\" Sophia said, her eyes shining with enthusiasm."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 951, "end": 1090, "text": "\"I'm also a badminton enthusiast, and I couldn't help but notice that you're listed on our project's focus list for tournament management.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1091, "end": 1128, "text": "Margreet's eyebrows rose in surprise."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1129, "end": 1137, "text": "\"Really?"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1138, "end": 1152, "text": "I had no idea."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1153, "end": 1262, "text": "I do enjoy playing badminton in my free time, but I never thought I'd be of interest to a Wikimedia project.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1263, "end": 1277, "text": "Sophia nodded."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1278, "end": 1378, "text": "\"Yes, we're always looking to improve our coverage of notable figures who are involved in the sport."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1379, "end": 1496, "text": "Your inclusion on the list is a testament to your dedication to badminton, even if it's not your primary profession.\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1497, "end": 1620, "text": "As they parted ways, Margreet couldn't help but feel a sense of pride in being recognized for her passion outside of music."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1621, "end": 1778, "text": "She made a mental note to look into the WikiProject Badminton\\/tournament focus list, curious to learn more about the community that had taken notice of her."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1779, "end": 1851, "text": "The encounter had been brief, but it had left an impression on Margreet."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1852, "end": 1993, "text": "As she changed out of her costume and prepared to leave the concert hall, she felt a sense of connection to the world beyond the opera stage."}}, "candidates": 